{{ 'ness-booking.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- comment -%}
  Booking page. Transcribed from project/Nessclusive Storefront.dc.html:567-778
  (data-screen-label="Booking").

  The prototype's three-step wizard is still deliberately not built: PLAN.md
  Decision #1 replaced it with a redirect to the studio's existing Acuity
  Scheduling page, so there is exactly one calendar to keep and no
  half-captured requests sitting in a theme with no backend. The revised design
  agrees — it now ends on a pair of links rather than a form, so this page and
  the design finish in the same place.

  Order, top to bottom: hero banner, the two buttons, "Plan your Perfect
  Style", then the Studio Info / Booking Policy / Custom Wig cards. The design
  closed on the buttons; they were moved up under the banner so a visitor who
  has already decided is not scrolled past four policy cards to reach them.
  The standalone booking panel the earlier revision drew between the steps and
  the cards is gone; its heading/body/note settings went with it.

  No JavaScript: every control on this page is a link, so the page is complete
  the moment the HTML arrives, and nothing here needs scripting to be readable.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  comment
    Booking URL, most specific first: a per-section override, then the
    site-wide theme setting (PLAN.md specifies a theme setting so every
    "Book a Session" control on the site reads one value), then the known
    Acuity link as a last resort so the button is never dead. This mirrors
    sections/ness-booking-banner.liquid exactly — the two must not drift.

    Kept on one line: inside a liquid tag every newline starts a new statement.
  endcomment
  assign booking_url = section.settings.booking_url | default: settings.acuity_url | default: 'https://nessclusive.as.me/schedule/6f74a017'
  assign cta_label = section.settings.cta_label | default: 'Book a Reservation'
  comment
    Falling back to the page's own title means the page can never render
    without an h1, whatever the merchant clears.
  endcomment
  assign hero_heading = section.settings.hero_heading | default: page.title | default: 'Book Nessclusive'
  assign steps = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'step'
  assign hours = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'hours_row'
  assign notes = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'policy_note'
  assign rules = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'policy_rule'
  assign fees = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'fee_row'
  assign steps_id = 'ness-booking-steps-' | append: section.id
  assign studio_id = 'ness-booking-studio-' | append: section.id
  assign policy_id = 'ness-booking-policy-' | append: section.id
  assign dropoff_id = 'ness-booking-dropoff-' | append: section.id
  comment
    tel: wants the digits only, but the merchant types the number the way it is
    printed. The separators are stripped here rather than asking for the number
    twice; a leading + survives, which is what an international number needs.
  endcomment
  assign phone_digits = section.settings.phone | remove: ' ' | remove: '-' | remove: '(' | remove: ')' | remove: '.'
  comment
    Social tiles are authored as handles, not URLs: the host is fixed in the
    markup so the tile cannot be pointed anywhere but the real profile, and a
    handle still has a sensible default where a `url` setting cannot have one.
    The @ is optional in the field and stripped before it reaches the path.
  endcomment
  assign instagram_handle = section.settings.instagram_handle | remove: '@'
  assign tiktok_handle = section.settings.tiktok_handle | remove: '@'
  comment
    Presence tests, same idea as the social row in ness-contact: a card is
    dropped entirely rather than painting a coloured panel with a heading and
    nothing under it.
  endcomment
  assign studio_any = section.settings.phone | append: section.settings.email | append: instagram_handle | append: tiktok_handle | append: section.settings.address | append: section.settings.address_note
  assign dropoff_any = section.settings.dropoff_body | append: section.settings.dropoff_note
-%}

<div class="ness-booking">
  {%- comment -%}
    Hero banner. The artwork is a real <img> rather than a CSS background so it
    can carry a srcset and be fetched eagerly — it is the first thing below the
    header on this template. The band's height is set in CSS and the image
    covers it, so any upload crops instead of distorting (Editability policy).

    `sizes` matches ness-booking-banner: the shell width less its side padding,
    which tops out at 1630px once the 1770px shell is reached.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="ness-booking__hero-band ness-shell">
    <div class="ness-booking__hero">
      <div class="ness-booking__hero-media">
        {%- if section.settings.hero_image != blank -%}
          {{
            section.settings.hero_image
            | image_url: width: 3000
            | image_tag:
              class: 'ness-booking__hero-image',
              alt: section.settings.hero_image.alt,
              widths: '750, 1100, 1500, 1900, 2400, 3000',
              sizes: '(min-width: 1770px) 1630px, calc(100vw - 40px)',
              loading: 'eager'
          }}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            Bundled prototype artwork as the default, so the page is never
            bare before a photo is chosen. Decorative: the headline over it
            carries the meaning.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <img
            class="ness-booking__hero-image"
            src="{{ 'ness-booking-bg.jpg' | asset_url }}"
            alt=""
            width="1600"
            height="1507"
            loading="eager"
          >
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      <h1 class="ness-booking__hero-heading">{{ hero_heading | escape }}</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    The two buttons the page opens on, sitting directly under the banner.

    They were at the foot of the page, which put the steps and four policy
    cards between a visitor who had already decided and the button they came
    for. The policy still has to be readable before booking, so it stays on
    the page — it just no longer gates the action.

    The Acuity link opens in a new tab and says so in its accessible name. A
    forced tab that goes unannounced is the accessibility problem, not the tab
    itself. Keeping this page open behind the scheduler also means a visitor
    who backs out of booking still has the policy and studio details where
    they left them.

    "Ask question" goes through ness-nav-url like every other internal link,
    so it cannot be pointed at a URL that does not exist, and it stays in this
    tab because it is an ordinary page on this site.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="ness-booking__actions ness-booking__actions--top ness-shell">
    {%- comment -%}
      The booking button is not conditional: cta_label falls back above, so an
      emptied field cannot leave this page without a way to book.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <a
      class="ness-booking__cta"
      href="{{ booking_url | escape }}"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      aria-label="{{ cta_label | escape }}, opens in a new tab"
    >
      {{- cta_label | escape -}}
    </a>

    {%- if section.settings.secondary_label != blank -%}
      {%- capture secondary_url -%}
        {%- render 'ness-nav-url', destination: section.settings.secondary_destination -%}
      {%- endcapture -%}
      <a class="ness-booking__cta ness-booking__cta--secondary" href="{{ secondary_url }}">
        {{- section.settings.secondary_label | escape -}}
      </a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    "Plan your Perfect Style". The wording still describes the real flow —
    Acuity asks for a service, then a date and time, then confirmation. Every
    circle is filled: in the prototype the second and third were greyed to show
    wizard progress, and with no wizard a permanently grey step would read as
    unavailable.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Throughout this section, aria-labelledby is emitted only when the heading
    it names is actually rendered. Pointing at an element that was never
    output leaves the region with an empty accessible name, which is worse
    than having none — same reasoning as ness-booking-banner.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if steps.size > 0 or section.settings.steps_heading != blank or section.settings.steps_eyebrow != blank -%}
    <section
      class="ness-booking__steps ness-shell"
      {% if section.settings.steps_heading != blank %}aria-labelledby="{{ steps_id }}"{% endif %}
    >
      {%- if section.settings.steps_heading != blank or section.settings.steps_eyebrow != blank -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Eyebrow, heading and rule are one flex group so a cleared eyebrow
          leaves no orphan space, exactly as in ness-services.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="ness-booking__steps-head">
          {%- if section.settings.steps_eyebrow != blank -%}
            <p class="ness-booking__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.steps_eyebrow | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if section.settings.steps_heading != blank -%}
            <h2 class="ness-booking__steps-heading" id="{{ steps_id }}">
              {{- section.settings.steps_heading | escape -}}
            </h2>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            Decorative rule: no meaning the heading does not already carry, so
            it is hidden rather than announced as an empty element.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <span class="ness-booking__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if steps.size > 0 -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          role="list" is not redundant: Safari drops list semantics from an <ol>
          whose list-style is none, which is exactly what the drawn circles
          require.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <ol class="ness-booking__steps-list" role="list">
          {%- for block in steps -%}
            <li class="ness-booking__step" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {%- comment -%}
                The circle is decoration — the <ol> already tells assistive tech
                which step this is and how many there are, and announcing the
                digit twice is noise.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <span class="ness-booking__step-number" aria-hidden="true">{{ forloop.index }}</span>
              <p class="ness-booking__step-label">{{ block.settings.label | escape }}</p>
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ol>
      {%- endif -%}
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    Studio Info — opening hours on the left, the contact tiles and the location
    on the right. The four contact tiles are the design's row: phone, email,
    Instagram and TikTok. Each is dropped individually when its field is
    cleared, so a studio without TikTok simply has three.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if hours.size > 0 or studio_any != blank -%}
    <section
      class="ness-booking__band ness-shell"
      {% if section.settings.studio_heading != blank %}aria-labelledby="{{ studio_id }}"{% endif %}
    >
      <div class="ness-booking__card ness-booking__card--studio">
        {%- if section.settings.studio_heading != blank or section.settings.studio_intro != blank -%}
          <div class="ness-booking__card-head">
            {%- comment -%}
              h2, not the design's h3: the hero is this page's h1 and these
              cards are its top-level regions, so h2 keeps the outline honest.
              The drawn size comes from CSS, which is where size belongs.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- if section.settings.studio_heading != blank -%}
              <h2 class="ness-booking__card-heading" id="{{ studio_id }}">
                {{- section.settings.studio_heading | escape -}}
              </h2>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.studio_intro != blank -%}
              <p class="ness-booking__card-intro">{{ section.settings.studio_intro | escape }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="ness-booking__card-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="ness-booking__studio-grid">
          {%- if hours.size > 0 -%}
            {%- comment -%}
              Plain wrappers here and in the contact column: the grid places
              them, so they need no styling of their own.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            <div>
              {%- if section.settings.hours_label != blank -%}
                <p class="ness-booking__group-label">{{ section.settings.hours_label | escape }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- for block in hours -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign row_value = block.settings.value
                  if block.settings.closed and row_value == blank
                    assign row_value = 'Closed'
                  endif
                -%}
                {%- comment -%}
                  A row with neither a day nor an opening time would draw a bare
                  hairline, so it is skipped rather than rendered empty.
                {%- endcomment -%}
                {%- if block.settings.day != blank or row_value != blank -%}
                  <div class="ness-booking__row" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                    <span class="ness-booking__row-key ness-booking__row-key--strong">
                      {{- block.settings.day | escape -}}
                    </span>
                    <span
                      class="ness-booking__row-value{% if block.settings.closed %} ness-booking__row-value--closed{% endif %}"
                    >
                      {{- row_value | escape -}}
                    </span>
                  </div>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if studio_any != blank -%}
            <div class="ness-booking__contact">
              {%- if section.settings.phone != blank or section.settings.email != blank or instagram_handle != blank or tiktok_handle != blank -%}
                <div>
                  {%- if section.settings.contact_label != blank -%}
                    <p class="ness-booking__group-label">{{ section.settings.contact_label | escape }}</p>
                  {%- endif -%}

                  {%- comment -%}
                    Tile labels (Phone, Email, Instagram, TikTok) are fixed by
                    the design in the same way the contact form's field labels
                    are — see the note in ness-contact.liquid. What the studio
                    changes is the number, the address and the handles.
                  {%- endcomment -%}
                  {%- if section.settings.phone != blank -%}
                    <a class="ness-booking__tile" href="tel:{{ phone_digits | escape }}">
                      <span class="ness-booking__tile-icon">
                        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .4 1.9.7 2.8a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8.1 9.9a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.2a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.5c.9.3 1.8.6 2.8.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2Z"/></svg>
                      </span>
                      <span class="ness-booking__tile-text">
                        <span class="ness-booking__tile-label">Phone</span>
                        <span class="ness-booking__tile-value">{{ section.settings.phone | escape }}</span>
                      </span>
                    </a>
                  {%- endif -%}

                  {%- if section.settings.email != blank -%}
                    <a class="ness-booking__tile" href="mailto:{{ section.settings.email | escape }}">
                      <span class="ness-booking__tile-icon">
                        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2.5"/><path d="m3 6.5 9 6 9-6"/></svg>
                      </span>
                      <span class="ness-booking__tile-text">
                        <span class="ness-booking__tile-label">Email</span>
                        <span class="ness-booking__tile-value">{{ section.settings.email | escape }}</span>
                      </span>
                    </a>
                  {%- endif -%}

                  {%- if instagram_handle != blank -%}
                    <a class="ness-booking__tile" href="https://instagram.com/{{ instagram_handle | escape }}">
                      <span class="ness-booking__tile-icon">
                        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="2.5" y="2.5" width="19" height="19" rx="5.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.4"/><circle cx="17.6" cy="6.4" r="1.1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
                      </span>
                      <span class="ness-booking__tile-text">
                        <span class="ness-booking__tile-label">Instagram</span>
                        <span class="ness-booking__tile-value">@{{ instagram_handle | escape }}</span>
                      </span>
                    </a>
                  {%- endif -%}

                  {%- if tiktok_handle != blank -%}
                    <a class="ness-booking__tile" href="https://tiktok.com/@{{ tiktok_handle | escape }}">
                      <span class="ness-booking__tile-icon">
                        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14 3.5c.6 2.7 2.3 4.4 5 4.7v3.2c-1.9.1-3.6-.5-5-1.6v5.7a5.9 5.9 0 1 1-5.1-5.9v3.3a2.7 2.7 0 1 0 1.9 2.6V3.5Z"/></svg>
                      </span>
                      <span class="ness-booking__tile-text">
                        <span class="ness-booking__tile-label">TikTok</span>
                        <span class="ness-booking__tile-value">@{{ tiktok_handle | escape }}</span>
                      </span>
                    </a>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- if section.settings.address != blank or section.settings.address_note != blank -%}
                <div>
                  {%- if section.settings.location_label != blank -%}
                    <p class="ness-booking__group-label">{{ section.settings.location_label | escape }}</p>
                  {%- endif -%}
                  <div class="ness-booking__location">
                    <span class="ness-booking__tile-icon ness-booking__tile-icon--top">
                      <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 10.5c0 6-8 12.5-8 12.5s-8-6.5-8-12.5a8 8 0 1 1 16 0Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10.3" r="3"/></svg>
                    </span>
                    <div>
                      {%- if section.settings.address != blank -%}
                        <p class="ness-booking__location-address">{{ section.settings.address | escape }}</p>
                      {%- endif -%}
                      {%- if section.settings.address_note != blank -%}
                        <p class="ness-booking__location-note">{{ section.settings.address_note | escape }}</p>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    Booking Policy. Two rows of tiles: the three "before you come" notes on the
    page background, then the numbered policies on cream, then the agreement
    line. Each tile's icon is chosen by the merchant from a short closed list
    so that reordering or rewording a tile cannot leave a clock beside a
    cancellation rule — the alternative, keying the icon off the tile's
    position, breaks silently the first time a tile is moved.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if notes.size > 0 or rules.size > 0 or section.settings.policy_footnote != blank -%}
    <section
      class="ness-booking__band ness-shell"
      {% if section.settings.policy_heading != blank %}aria-labelledby="{{ policy_id }}"{% endif %}
    >
      <div class="ness-booking__card ness-booking__card--policy">
        {%- if section.settings.policy_heading != blank or section.settings.policy_intro != blank -%}
          <div class="ness-booking__card-head">
            {%- if section.settings.policy_heading != blank -%}
              <h2 class="ness-booking__card-heading" id="{{ policy_id }}">
                {{- section.settings.policy_heading | escape -}}
              </h2>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.policy_intro != blank -%}
              <p class="ness-booking__card-intro">{{ section.settings.policy_intro | escape }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="ness-booking__card-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if notes.size > 0 -%}
          <div class="ness-booking__notes">
            {%- for block in notes -%}
              <div class="ness-booking__note" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <span class="ness-booking__note-icon">
                  {%- case block.settings.icon -%}
                    {%- when 'health' -%}
                      <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14 25s-9-5.6-9-12.4A5 5 0 0 1 14 9.4 5 5 0 0 1 23 12.6C23 19.4 14 25 14 25Z"/></svg>
                    {%- when 'guests' -%}
                      <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="14" cy="9" r="4"/><path d="M6 24c1-4.3 4.2-6.5 8-6.5s7 2.2 8 6.5"/><circle cx="23.4" cy="10.6" r="2.6"/><circle cx="4.6" cy="10.6" r="2.6"/></svg>
                    {%- when 'deposit' -%}
                      <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="3" y="7" width="22" height="14" rx="2.5"/><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="3.4"/><path d="M7 11.5v5M21 11.5v5"/></svg>
                  {%- endcase -%}
                </span>
                {%- if block.settings.label != blank -%}
                  <p class="ness-booking__note-label">{{ block.settings.label | escape }}</p>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
                  <p class="ness-booking__note-text">{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</p>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if rules.size > 0 -%}
          {%- if section.settings.policy_rules_label != blank -%}
            <p class="ness-booking__group-label ness-booking__group-label--spaced">
              {{- section.settings.policy_rules_label | escape -}}
            </p>
          {%- endif -%}
          <div class="ness-booking__rules">
            {%- for block in rules -%}
              <div class="ness-booking__policy" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <span class="ness-booking__note-icon">
                  {%- case block.settings.icon -%}
                    {%- when 'schedule' -%}
                      <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="4" y="6" width="20" height="18" rx="2.5"/><path d="M4 11h20M9.5 3.5v5M18.5 3.5v5"/></svg>
                    {%- when 'cancellation' -%}
                      <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="10.5"/><path d="M10.4 10.4l7.2 7.2M17.6 10.4l-7.2 7.2"/></svg>
                    {%- when 'reschedule' -%}
                      <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="4" y="6" width="20" height="18" rx="2.5"/><path d="M4 11h20M9.5 3.5v5M18.5 3.5v5M10 18h6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5H13"/><path d="M14.6 10.6L12.4 13l2.2 2.4"/></svg>
                    {%- when 'lateness' -%}
                      <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="10.5"/><path d="M14 8v6.4l4 2.4"/></svg>
                  {%- endcase -%}
                </span>
                {%- if block.settings.label != blank -%}
                  <p class="ness-booking__note-label">{{ block.settings.label | escape }}</p>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
                  <p class="ness-booking__note-text">{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</p>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.policy_footnote != blank -%}
          <p class="ness-booking__footnote">{{ section.settings.policy_footnote | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    Custom Wig, Coloring & Drop off — the drop-off rules beside the late
    drop-off charges. The charges are a term/amount list rather than free text
    so the two columns stay aligned however the fees are edited.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if dropoff_any != blank or fees.size > 0 -%}
    <section
      class="ness-booking__band ness-shell"
      {% if section.settings.dropoff_heading != blank %}aria-labelledby="{{ dropoff_id }}"{% endif %}
    >
      <div class="ness-booking__card ness-booking__card--dropoff">
        {%- if section.settings.dropoff_heading != blank or section.settings.dropoff_intro != blank -%}
          <div class="ness-booking__card-head">
            {%- if section.settings.dropoff_heading != blank -%}
              <h2 class="ness-booking__card-heading" id="{{ dropoff_id }}">
                {{- section.settings.dropoff_heading | escape -}}
              </h2>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.dropoff_intro != blank -%}
              <p class="ness-booking__card-intro">{{ section.settings.dropoff_intro | escape }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="ness-booking__card-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="ness-booking__dropoff-grid">
          {%- if dropoff_any != blank -%}
            <div class="ness-booking__drop">
              <span class="ness-booking__note-icon">
                <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 10.5 14 5l10 5.5v9L14 25 4 19.5Z"/><path d="M4 10.5 14 16l10-5.5M14 16v9"/></svg>
              </span>
              {%- if section.settings.dropoff_label != blank -%}
                <p class="ness-booking__note-label">{{ section.settings.dropoff_label | escape }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if section.settings.dropoff_body != blank -%}
                <p class="ness-booking__drop-text">{{ section.settings.dropoff_body | escape }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if section.settings.dropoff_note != blank -%}
                <p class="ness-booking__drop-note">{{ section.settings.dropoff_note | escape }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if fees.size > 0 -%}
            <div class="ness-booking__drop">
              <span class="ness-booking__note-icon">
                <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="10.5"/><path d="M14 8.5v11M17 11.2c-.7-.9-1.8-1.4-3-1.4-1.8 0-3.2 1-3.2 2.5 0 3.2 6.4 1.7 6.4 4.9 0 1.6-1.4 2.6-3.2 2.6-1.3 0-2.5-.5-3.2-1.5"/></svg>
              </span>
              {%- if section.settings.fees_label != blank -%}
                <p class="ness-booking__note-label">{{ section.settings.fees_label | escape }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
              <div>
                {%- for block in fees -%}
                  {%- if block.settings.term != blank or block.settings.amount != blank -%}
                    <div class="ness-booking__row" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                      <span class="ness-booking__row-key">{{ block.settings.term | escape }}</span>
                      <span class="ness-booking__row-amount">{{ block.settings.amount | escape }}</span>
                    </div>
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Booking page",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Appointments are taken on Acuity, not on this page — the booking button sends visitors to the Acuity link in Theme settings → Nessclusive. All of the wording, the banner photo, the opening hours, and every card below are yours to edit. Layout, colours, and type are fixed by the design."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The page's own body text in Shopify admin is not shown on this template. Put everything you want visitors to read into the fields below."
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Banner" },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "hero_image",
      "label": "Banner photo",
      "info": "Sits behind a purple wash and is cropped to fit, so nothing ever stretches. A wide landscape photo of at least 2400 × 900 works best."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "hero_heading",
      "label": "Banner heading",
      "default": "Book Nessclusive",
      "info": "This is the page's main heading. Leave it empty and the page name is used instead."
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Plan your Perfect Style" },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "steps_eyebrow",
      "label": "Small heading above",
      "default": "Before you arrive"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "steps_heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Plan your Perfect Style"
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Studio info" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "studio_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Studio Info" },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "studio_intro",
      "label": "Line under the heading",
      "default": "Hours, contact and where to find us."
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hours_label", "label": "Opening hours label", "default": "Office Hours" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "contact_label", "label": "Contact label", "default": "Contact" },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "phone",
      "label": "Phone number",
      "default": "917-587-8962",
      "info": "Shown as you type it and dialled with the spaces and dashes removed. Leave empty to hide the phone tile."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "email",
      "label": "Email address",
      "default": "info@nessclusive.com",
      "info": "Leave empty to hide the email tile."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "instagram_handle",
      "label": "Instagram handle",
      "default": "@nessclusive",
      "info": "Just the handle — the instagram.com address is added for you. Leave empty to hide the tile."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tiktok_handle",
      "label": "TikTok handle",
      "default": "@nessclusive_",
      "info": "Just the handle — the tiktok.com address is added for you. Leave empty to hide the tile."
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "location_label", "label": "Location label", "default": "Location" },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "address",
      "label": "Street address",
      "info": "Intentionally has no default — the studio address goes out in the reminder email instead, and the note below says so. Fill this in only if you want the address published on the page. (Shopify rejects a schema whose default is an empty string, so the key is omitted rather than blanked.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "address_note",
      "label": "Location note",
      "default": "Exact address is sent in a reminder email 24 hours before your appointment.",
      "info": "Shown in bold capitals — type it as a normal sentence and the design does the rest. Leave empty to hide it."
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Booking policy" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "policy_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Booking Policy" },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "policy_intro",
      "label": "Line under the heading",
      "default": "Important — please read before booking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "policy_rules_label",
      "label": "Label above the second row of tiles",
      "default": "Booking Policies"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "policy_footnote",
      "label": "Agreement line",
      "default": "By booking you have accepted and agreed to the terms of this policy.",
      "info": "The last line of the card. Leave empty to hide it."
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Custom wig, coloring & drop off" },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "dropoff_heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Custom Wig, Coloring & Drop off"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "dropoff_intro",
      "label": "Line under the heading",
      "default": "Text 917-587-8962 or email info@nessclusive.com for all wig orders."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "dropoff_label",
      "label": "First tile label",
      "default": "Wig / Hair Drop Off"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "dropoff_body",
      "label": "First tile text",
      "default": "All frontals, closures and wigs must be dropped off 4–5 days in advance or a fee will be charged."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "dropoff_note",
      "label": "First tile second line",
      "default": "Contact me for the address. Please do not come to the shop without prior knowledge.",
      "info": "The quieter line under the drop-off rule. Leave empty to hide it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "fees_label",
      "label": "Second tile label",
      "default": "Late Drop Off Charge",
      "info": "Sits above the list of late drop-off charges."
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Buttons" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_label", "label": "Booking button label", "default": "Book a Reservation" },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "booking_url",
      "label": "Booking link (optional override)",
      "info": "Leave empty to use the site-wide Acuity link from Theme settings → Nessclusive. Only set this to send THIS page somewhere different."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "secondary_label",
      "label": "Second button label",
      "default": "Ask question",
      "info": "Leave empty to show the booking button on its own."
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "secondary_destination",
      "label": "Second button goes to",
      "default": "contact_anchor",
      "options": [
        { "value": "contact_anchor", "label": "Contact section on the home page" },
        { "value": "contact", "label": "Contact page" },
        { "value": "faqs", "label": "FAQs page" },
        { "value": "all_products", "label": "All products" },
        { "value": "ready_to_ship", "label": "Ready to Ship" },
        { "value": "pre_order", "label": "Pre-Order" },
        { "value": "accessories", "label": "Accessories" },
        { "value": "home", "label": "Home page" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 30,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "step",
      "name": "Preparation step",
      "limit": 4,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "label",
          "label": "What happens at this step",
          "default": "Select Your Desired Service",
          "info": "The number is added automatically from the order of the steps. The design was drawn for three or four."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "hours_row",
      "name": "Opening hours row",
      "limit": 7,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "day", "label": "Day", "default": "Monday" },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "value",
          "label": "Hours",
          "default": "10:30am – 7pm",
          "info": "For example 10:30am – 7pm."
        },
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "closed",
          "label": "Closed this day",
          "default": false,
          "info": "Greys the row the way the design draws a closed day. If you leave the hours empty it reads “Closed”."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "policy_note",
      "name": "Policy note",
      "limit": 3,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "icon",
          "label": "Symbol",
          "default": "health",
          "options": [
            { "value": "health", "label": "Heart (health)" },
            { "value": "guests", "label": "People (guests)" },
            { "value": "deposit", "label": "Card (deposit)" }
          ]
        },
        { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Label", "default": "Health" },
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "Text",
          "default": "Please stay safe. Cancel 24hrs if you are feeling sick.",
          "info": "Around 100 characters is what the design was drawn for."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "policy_rule",
      "name": "Booking policy",
      "limit": 4,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "icon",
          "label": "Symbol",
          "default": "schedule",
          "options": [
            { "value": "schedule", "label": "Calendar (scheduling)" },
            { "value": "cancellation", "label": "Cross (cancellation)" },
            { "value": "reschedule", "label": "Calendar with arrow (reschedule)" },
            { "value": "lateness", "label": "Clock (lateness)" }
          ]
        },
        { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Label", "default": "Schedule" },
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "Text",
          "default": "Book at least 5 days ahead, that way you can prevent extra costs.",
          "info": "Around 140 characters is what the design was drawn for."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "fee_row",
      "name": "Late drop-off charge",
      "limit": 6,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "term", "label": "How late", "default": "3 days" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "amount", "label": "Charge", "default": "$15 fee" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "default": {
    "blocks": [
      { "type": "step", "settings": { "label": "Select Your Desired Service" } },
      { "type": "step", "settings": { "label": "Select your preferable Time & date" } },
      { "type": "step", "settings": { "label": "Confirm and Get Ready" } },
      { "type": "hours_row", "settings": { "day": "Monday", "value": "Closed", "closed": true } },
      { "type": "hours_row", "settings": { "day": "Tuesday", "value": "10:30am – 7pm" } },
      { "type": "hours_row", "settings": { "day": "Wednesday", "value": "10:30am – 7pm" } },
      { "type": "hours_row", "settings": { "day": "Thursday", "value": "10:30am – 7pm" } },
      { "type": "hours_row", "settings": { "day": "Friday", "value": "10:30am – 7pm" } },
      { "type": "hours_row", "settings": { "day": "Saturday", "value": "10:30am – 7pm" } },
      { "type": "hours_row", "settings": { "day": "Sunday", "value": "Closed", "closed": true } },
      {
        "type": "policy_note",
        "settings": {
          "icon": "health",
          "label": "Health",
          "text": "Please stay safe. Cancel 24hrs if you are feeling sick."
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "policy_note",
        "settings": {
          "icon": "guests",
          "label": "Guests",
          "text": "No extra guests — limited space and private client experiences only."
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "policy_note",
        "settings": {
          "icon": "deposit",
          "label": "Deposit",
          "text": "A non-refundable $40 deposit secures your booking. Remaining balance must be paid in cash or Zelle only."
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "policy_rule",
        "settings": {
          "icon": "schedule",
          "label": "Schedule",
          "text": "Book at least 5 days ahead, that way you can prevent extra costs."
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "policy_rule",
        "settings": {
          "icon": "cancellation",
          "label": "Cancellation",
          "text": "Same day — deposit lost and 50% of service charged."
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "policy_rule",
        "settings": {
          "icon": "reschedule",
          "label": "Reschedule",
          "text": "You can reschedule once with your deposit in the same month. Reschedule up to 3 days before your original appointment. No exceptions!"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "policy_rule",
        "settings": {
          "icon": "lateness",
          "label": "Lateness",
          "text": "You have a 10 min grace period. After 10 min you will be charged a $20 fee. After 20 mins the appointment will be cancelled."
        }
      },
      { "type": "fee_row", "settings": { "term": "3 days", "amount": "$15 fee" } },
      { "type": "fee_row", "settings": { "term": "2 days", "amount": "$25 fee" } },
      { "type": "fee_row", "settings": { "term": "1 day", "amount": "Not accepted" } },
      { "type": "fee_row", "settings": { "term": "Same day customization", "amount": "$40 fee" } }
    ]
  }
}
{% endschema %}
